1..14
ok - a converging full round records the ledger and approves through ak review decide
ok - a converging round drops a finding whose category only resembles a declared one
ok - a fix-only round reviews the delta and closes the finding its seat raised
ok - after round 1 a new finding without a reproduction is filed as a follow-up, and no single seat vetoes
ok - a new finding whose reproduction fails at the head and passes at the merge base blocks
ok - a green reproduction beside an introduced one in the same round never drops the introduced evidence
ok - a correctness finding whose reproduction is red at the head and at the merge base does not block
ok - a security finding whose reproduction is red at both still blocks
not ok - converge repro-off: a closure round with a reproduction and no opt-in: expected exit 1, got 2
